OL,4,Amaterial left online for weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FViolent material was still available
OL,7,Fonline two weeks after being reported
OL,8,Fin more than 80% of cases, a review for
OL,9,Fthe Southport Inquiry has found.
OL,11,FThe hearing was told a report examining
OL,12,Fthe 'real-world accessibility' of
OL,13,Fviolent content and weapons sales
OL,14,Fonline found concerning material on
OL,15,Fplatforms including X, TikTok and
OL,16,FInstagram.
