OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public inquiry, which is in its
OL,7,Fsecond phase, is examining issues
OL,8,Fsurrounding 'violence-fixated
OL,9,Findividuals' following the knife attack
OL,10,Fat a dance class in Southport on 29
OL,11,FJuly 2024.
OL,13,FThree girls were killed and 23 other
OL,14,Fchildren suffered physical or
OL,15,Fpsychological injuries.
